# Privacy Policy for Adv.Attachments

**Last Updated**: October 3, 2026

## Data Collection

**Adv.Attachments does not collect, transmit, or store any telemetry, analytics, or personal data.**

All processing occurs locally within your YouTrack instance and your configured S3 storage.

## External Services

**The app contacts only your configured S3 endpoint** — for file storage operations (upload, download, list, delete). Only the endpoint you explicitly configure in Admin Settings is used.

Preview libraries (docx-preview, SheetJS/xlsx, odf-kit) are bundled with the app. No CDN or other external services are contacted.

## Data Processing

- The app reads issue attachment metadata via YouTrack's internal API
- S3 file operations use presigned URLs generated server-side; credentials never leave the backend
- Generated presigned URLs are short-lived (configurable TTL) and scoped to specific operations
- No file content, user data, or credentials are logged or transmitted to third parties
- S3 credentials are stored in YouTrack App Settings and never returned by the API

